<title>GERMANY: ATHLETICS-BERLIN MARATHON RESULTS.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-BERLIN MARATHON RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BERLIN 1996-09-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Official results of the 23rd</p>
<p>annual Berlin marathon on Sunday:</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p> 1. Abel Anton (Spain)		  2 hours 9 minutes 15 seconds</p>
<p> 2. Francis Naaly (Tanzania)	  2:09.36</p>
<p> 3. Sammy Lelei (Kenya)		 2:09.52</p>
<p> 4. Gilbert Rutto (Kenya)	     2:10.04</p>
<p> 5. Martin Ndiveni (South Africa)   2:10.21</p>
<p> 6. Sammy Maritim (Kenya)	     2:11.22</p>
<p> 7. Paul Yego (Kenya)		   2:11.25</p>
<p> 8. Philipe Remond (France)	   2:12.05</p>
<p> 9. Edger Moreno Fialho (Brazil)    2:13.07</p>
<p> 10. Sakae Osaki (Japan)		2:13.42</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>1. Colleen de Reuck (South Africa) 2:26.36</p>
<p> 2. Renata Kokowska (Poland)	  2:27.41</p>
<p> 3. Marlene Renders (Belgium)	 2:27.42</p>
<p> 4. Claudia Lokar (Germany)	   2:28.17</p>
<p> 5. Judith Nagy (Hungary)	     2:28.53</p>
